It is a shortcut of the longer path sdh:C13 Geographical Place, (inverse of) crmP195 was presence of, crm:P167 was within, crm:E53 Place, crm:P168 is defined by.</rdfs:comment>
                <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">has geocoordinates</rdfs:label>
